    "Local microbenchmarks with equal-output checks; no timing assertions.",
    "Other local builds were active during collection; timings do not establish isolated before/after speedups or end-to-end throughput.",
    "Expression, global and grouped aggregate, and window cases alternate scalar/refined order across three samples; sort and join have one sample per size.",
